# Aragorn's "creatures can't block this turn" is a rule-changing effect, not a change of characteristics, so it covers
# creatures that did not exist when it resolved (CR 611.2c applies only to the latter). Bot2 passes with the trigger on
# the stack, lets it resolve, and only then flashes in Cathar Commando; Bot2 is still never asked to declare blockers.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Aragorn, King of Gondor
Elvish Mystic
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Cathar Commando
Plains x12

